# Build leftovers that @expo/fingerprint's default ignore list misses (M0.4). Without these
# the fingerprint changes during and after every local Gradle build, so the hash embedded in
# a binary would never equal what `eas update` resolves from the same tree.
# Kotlin 2 compiler session files (android/.kotlin/sessions/*) in the app and in gradle plugins
**/android/.kotlin/**/*
**/*-gradle-plugin/.kotlin/**/*
# react-native-video sets its buildDir to android/buildOutput_<hash>
**/node_modules/react-native-video/android/buildOutput_*/**/*
